# Emulator-only values for the E2E suite. The project id is the reserved
# `demo-tankmaleh`, which the Firebase emulators special-case to refuse contact
# with any real Google service, and the API key is a placeholder they never
# validate. It has to be committed for CI to have any configuration at all.
